 {:db/id "step-72ddc09a-f634-56d2-8672-530624c19756" :step/id #uuid "72ddc09a-f634-56d2-8672-530624c19756" :step/content 17592186259862 :step/next "step-cf11a650-818b-5113-814d-d314e6ffeae5" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-cf11a650-818b-5113-814d-d314e6ffeae5" :step/id #uuid "cf11a650-818b-5113-814d-d314e6ffeae5" :step/content 17592186259863 :step/next "step-f0952fec-ef63-5ff2-9799-e1132e4419d4" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-f0952fec-ef63-5ff2-9799-e1132e4419d4" :step/id #uuid "f0952fec-ef63-5ff2-9799-e1132e4419d4" :step/content 17592186419017 :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231453 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-1bfb5188-7c59-596d-bb0b-41e90d79e407"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231738 :question/problem "| $t$ | $g(t)$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-2$ | $3$ |\n| $-1$ | $-4$ |\n| $1$ | $0$ |\n| $2$ | $2$ |\n\nThe table above gives values of a function $g$ on the set $T=\\{-2,-1,1,2\\}.$ Compute the following:\n\n${max}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $3,-4,0,$ and $2.$ The maximum output is $3$ (at $t=-2$), and the minimum output is $-4$ (at $t=-1$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-2 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-4 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:questio